      "url": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Nov/3/a-sound-that-leaks-your-exact-location/",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-03T05:32:25.000Z",
      "snippet": " <p><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UytYrhYLOKI\">I discovered a sound that leaks your exact location (and it&#x27;s everywhere) - YouTube</a></strong></p> Genius piece of OSINT by Colsto, who demonstrates how you can take almost imperceptible background noise of planes from a video soundtrack, figure out their Doppler curves, then cross reference them against ADS-B data to find the exact location of the video based on their speed, distance, and gaps between different flights.</p",
